# Dino Crisis 3 (43430003), Nova. Built from the generic survey
# 1790928772-titleroutes-2771139 (lane.titleroutes session 65, 2026-10-02),
# which reached live play and then left it. Read from its route-frames
# (copied to scratch/judge/), not guessed:
#   booted (012209): the intro FMV (space station).
#   cycle 1 (012215 START / 012221 A): START skips the FMV to "PRESS START
#     BUTTON"; A does nothing there.
#   cycle 2 (012227 START / 012234 A): START opens NEW GAME / OPTIONS (New
#     Game highlighted); A picks it -> EASY / NORMAL / HARD (Normal lit).
#   cycle 3 (012240 START / 012245 A): START confirms Normal (black), then
#     NOW LOADING.
#   cycle 4 (012251 START / 012256 A): a starfield FMV (FPS 37).
#   cycle 5 (012302 START / 012309 A): black, then the first corridor with
#     the HUD (health/weapon bars) and Patrick standing in it: live play.
#   cycle 6 (012314 START / 012320 A): the "Game Controls" tutorial pops up
#     (page 1 BACK=B / NEXT=A, page 2 BACK=B / CLOSE=A).
#   cycle 7 (012326 START / 012332 A): back in the corridor.
#   cycle 8 (012337 START): START in play opens OPTIONS, and the survey's
#     START/A presses never leave it again: the whole scored window was the
#     Options screen at a steady 29 fps. That is the trap this route avoids.
# So: the survey's first 7 cycles, then two B presses (B is Cancel in the
# Options screen and in the tutorial, and Jump in play, so it is harmless
# wherever it lands), then a play loop with NO START and no BACK. Its A
# presses (Inspect in play) also step through the tutorial if it is still
# up. Load times vary between runs; an overshoot lands on Options, which
# the B presses close.
# DRAFT until a dispatch run replays it and its frames from the mark on are
# reviewed.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted
repeat 7 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
press A
wait 2
press A
wait 2
press B
wait 2
press B
wait 3
shot pre-mark
mark gameplay               # CHECK: the corridor with the HUD, no tutorial or Options over it
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    press X
    wait 1
    press A
    wait 2
    axis LX max
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    wait 3
    press X
    wait 1
    axis LX min
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    wait 2
    press B
    wait 2
    shot play
}
